      "message": "No launcher should hold a lock on a subnode while the main node is in requested or building (neither this launcher nor any other).  There\u0027s a check in isNodeActionable for that.\n\nI think there is an error here, in that the update to slot_host should come after the subnode state changes (in order to keep that check effective), and also as you point out, to avoid a situation where we fail here and then don\u0027t update the subnode.",
